msgid "Obtain keycode necklace\n"
msgstr "Obtener el collar-código\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_018"
msgid "Download project files\n"
msgstr "Descargar los ficheros del proyecto\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_019"
msgid "Disable external comms hub\n"
msgstr "Desactivar puerto de com. externas\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_020"
msgid "Gain entrance to laboratory\n"
msgstr "Entrar en el laboratorio\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_021"
msgid "Who are you and what are you doing here?\n"
msgstr "¿Quién eres tú y qué estás haciendo aquí?\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_022"
msgid "Look out! She's got a gun.\n"
msgstr "¡Cuidado! Tiene un arma.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_023"
msgid "You won't shoot me, foolish child!\n"
msgstr "¡No me dispararás, tonta criatura!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_024"
msgid "Don't you know who I am?\n"
msgstr "¿No sabes quién soy?\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_025"
msgid "Let's see how you deal with security.\n"
msgstr "Veamos cómo te las apañas con seguridad.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_026"
msgid "PLEASE!!!!  Don't kill me!\n"
msgstr "¡¡¡¡POR FAVOR!!!!  ¡No me mates!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_027"
msgid "If I were you, I'd leave... NOW!\n"
msgstr "Si fuera tú, me marcharía... ¡AHORA!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_028"
msgid "Badly placed ECM Mine.\n"
msgstr "Mina ECM mal colocada.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_029"
msgid "ECM Mine placed correctly.\n"
msgstr "Mina ECM colocada correctamente.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_030"
msgid "MISSION FAILED - objectives incomplete.\n"
msgstr "MISIÓN FALLADA: objetivos incompletos.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_031"
msgid "       MISSION SUCCESSFUL      \n"
msgstr "       MISIÓN CONSEGUIDA      \n"

msgctxt "L_AME_032"
msgid "CANNOT complete all objectives.\n"
msgstr "NO PUEDES completar todos los objetivos.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_033"
msgid "Time to erase those files.\n"
msgstr "Es hora de borrar esos ficheros.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_034"
msgid "Computer executive erased.\n"
msgstr "Ordenador del ejecutivo borrado.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_035"
msgid "I'll do what you want!\n"
msgstr "¡Haré lo que tú quieras!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_036"
msgid "HELP - Intruder!\n"
msgstr "AYUDA. ¡Intruso!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_037"
msgid "You talk too much.\n"
msgstr "Hablas demasiado.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_038"
msgid "HELP, HELP!\n"
msgstr "¡AYUDA, AYUDA!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_039"
msgid "I'll do what you want...\n"
msgstr "¡Haré lo que tú quieras!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_040"
msgid "Logging on now...\n"
msgstr "Conectando ahora...\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_041"
msgid "Okay, I'm in...\n"
msgstr "Vale, estoy dentro...\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_042"
msgid "Goodbye, Dr. Caroll.\n"
msgstr "Adiós, Dr. Caroll.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_043"
msgid "You've written your last bug, traitor!\n"
msgstr "¡Has procesado tu último error, traidor!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_044"
msgid "File download initiated.\n"
msgstr "Descarga del fichero iniciada.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_045"
msgid "File download completed.\n"
msgstr "Descarga del fichero completada.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_046"
msgid "ACCESS DENIED - password needed.\n"
msgstr "ACCESO DENEGADO. Necesitas la contraseña.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_047"
msgid "Door unlocked.\n"
msgstr "Puerta desbloqueada.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_048"
msgid "DOH!\n"
msgstr "¡OH!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_049"
msgid "Unable to download - Data Uplink needed.\n"
msgstr "Imposible descargar. Necesitas un Conector de Datos.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_050"
msgid "LIGHTS NOW ON\n"
msgstr "LUCES ENCENDIDAS\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_051"
msgid "LIGHTS NOW OFF\n"
msgstr "LUCES APAGADAS\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_052"
msgid "Erase Dr. Caroll conversation...\n"
msgstr "Borra la conversación del Dr. Caroll...\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_053"
msgid "Don't shoot, don't shoot!\n"
msgstr "¡No dispares, no dispares!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_054"
msgid "Critical mission object destroyed.\n"
msgstr "Objeto crítico de la misión destruido.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_055"
msgid "Unacceptable civilian casualties.\n"
msgstr "Bajas civiles inaceptables.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_056"
msgid ""
"MISSION FAILED \n"
" - objectives cannot be completed.\n"
msgstr ""
"MISIÓN FALLADA:\n"
" los objetivos no pueden ser completados.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_057"
msgid "Critical mission personnel killed.\n"
msgstr "Ha muerto una persona crítica para la misión.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_058"
msgid "Obtain ECM Mines.\n"
msgstr "Obtén las Minas ECM.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_059"
msgid "Dr. Caroll's\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll:\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_060"
msgid "ECM Mine\n"
msgstr "Mina ECM\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_061"
msgid "An ECM Mine\n"
msgstr "Una Mina ECM\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_062"
msgid "Picked up an ECM Mine.\n"
msgstr "Mina ECM obtenida.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_063"
msgid "Obtain Data Uplink.\n"
msgstr "Obtén el Conector de Datos.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_064"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_065"
msgid "Data Uplink\n"
msgstr "C. Datos\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_066"
msgid "A Data Uplink\n"
msgstr "Un Conector de Datos\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_067"
msgid "Picked up a Data Uplink.\n"
msgstr "Conector de Datos obtenido.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_068"
msgid ""
"Yes, yes, I agree. Personality is expendable\n"
" in this case.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sí, sí, estoy de acuerdo. La personalidad es prescindible\n"
" en este caso.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_069"
msgid ""
"No, I can start the process from my office\n"
" terminal and delete the necessary files\n"
" at the same time.\n"
msgstr ""
"No, puedo empezar el proceso desde el terminal\n"
" de mi oficina y borrar los ficheros necesarios\n"
" al mismo tiempo.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_070"
msgid "I'll begin at once. Goodbye.\n"
msgstr "Empezaré enseguida. Adiós.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_071"
msgid "Move it!\n"
msgstr "¡En marcha!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_072"
msgid ""
"I've got a password problem, and you're \n"
"the man to help me with it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tengo un problema de contraseñas, y tú \n"
"eres el hombre que puede ayudarme con ello.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_073"
msgid "Don't shoot, don't shoot!\n"
msgstr "¡No dispares, no dispares!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_074"
msgid "Datalink broken - connection terminated.\n"
msgstr "Enlace de Datos perdido - conexión terminada.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_075"
msgid "Datalink error - incomplete file download.\n"
msgstr "Error en el Enlace de Datos - descarga de fichero incompleta.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_076"
msgid "Internal security system temporarily disabled.\n"
msgstr "Sistema de seguridad interno temporalmente desactivado.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_077"
msgid "External communications hub disabled.\n"
msgstr "Puerto de comunicaciones externas desactivado.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_078"
msgid "Laboratory lift located.\n"
msgstr "Ascensor del laboratorio localizado.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_079"
msgid "Security... Help me!\n"
msgstr "Seguridad... ¡Ayúdenme!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_080"
msgid "ECM Mine needed to disable security hub.\n"
msgstr "Mina ECM requerida para desactivar el puerto de seguridad.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_081"
msgid "ECM Mine needed to disable comms hub.\n"
msgstr "Mina ECM requerida para desactivar el puerto de comunicaciones.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_082"
msgid "Dummy\n"
msgstr "Tonto\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_083"
msgid "How dare you disturb me!\n"
msgstr "¡Cómo te atreves a molestarme!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_084"
msgid "You will regret this intrusion, girl!\n"
msgstr "¡Te vas a arrepentir de esta intrusión, chica!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_085"
msgid "If I were you, I'd leave...NOW!\n"
msgstr "Si yo fuera tú, me iría... ¡YA!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_086"
msgid "Please don't kill me!\n"
msgstr "¡Por favor, no me mates!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_087"
msgid "Don't shoot!\n"
msgstr "¡No dispares!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_088"
msgid "Obtain CamSpy.\n"
msgstr "Obtén la Cámara Espía.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_089"
msgid "Dr. Caroll's\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll:\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_090"
msgid "CamSpy\n"
msgstr "Cámara Espía\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_091"
msgid "A CamSpy\n"
msgstr "Una Cámara Espía\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_092"
msgid "Picked up a CamSpy.\n"
msgstr "Cámara Espía obtenida.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_093"
msgid ""
"We're getting a positive reading - \n"
"the internal comms hub is nearby.\n"
msgstr ""
"Estamos obteniendo una lectura positiva. \n"
"El puerto de comunicaciones interno está cerca.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_094"
msgid ""
"You're on the same floor as \n"
"Cassandra's office.\n"
msgstr ""
"Estás en la misma planta que \n"
"la oficina de Cassandra.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_095"
msgid ""
"The other hub has got to be in the \n"
"Security Room.\n"
msgstr ""
"El otro puerto debe estar en la \n"
"Sala de Seguridad.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_096"
msgid ""
"The basement elevator must be around \n"
"there somewhere.\n"
msgstr ""
"El ascensor del sótano debe de estar por \n"
"aquí en algún lugar.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_097"
msgid "Security system is now back online.\n"
msgstr "El sistema de seguridad está activo de nuevo.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_098"
msgid "You vandal, you've broken it!\n"
msgstr "¡Vándalo! ¡Lo has roto!\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_099"
msgid "2023 AD, 2214 Hours  Lucerne Tower - dataDyne HQ\n"
msgstr "2023 d.C., 2214 Horas  Edificio Lucerne - CG dataDyne\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_100"
msgid "Why the big hurry?\n"
msgstr "¿Por qué tanta prisa?\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_101"
msgid ""
"If Dr. Caroll is not extracted tonight, \n"
"dataDyne will put him through mind \n"
"conditioning, and we'll lose our best \n"
"chance of finding out what dataDyne \n"
"are up to.\n"
msgstr ""
"Si no sacamos al Dr. Caroll esta noche, \n"
"dataDyne le lavará el cerebro, y \n"
"perderemos nuestra mejor oportunidad \n"
"de descubrir las intenciones de \n"
"dataDyne.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_102"
msgid "Are they all expendable?\n"
msgstr "¿Son todos prescindibles?\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_103"
msgid ""
"Don't joke! You have to be careful, Joanna. \n"
"Code keys will only operate while the owner \n"
"is alive... If you kill them, the key is \n"
"useless. Armed guards are a different matter, \n"
"of course.\n"
msgstr ""
"¡No bromees! Tienes que ser cuidadosa, Joanna. \n"
"Las llaves código sólo funcionan cuando el \n"
"propietario está vivo... Si les matas, la llave \n"
"es inútil. Los guardas armados son otra cosa, \n"
"por supuesto.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_104"
msgid "What's the target location?\n"
msgstr "¿Dónde se encuentra el objetivo?\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_105"
msgid ""
"Work your way down the building to the ground \n"
"level. Dr. Caroll will be in a research lab \n"
"somewhere in the underground facility.\n"
msgstr ""
"Debes bajar todo el edificio hasta la planta \n"
"baja. El Dr. Caroll estará en el laboratorio de \n"
"investigación en algún lugar del subsuelo.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_106"
msgid "How will I recognize him?\n"
msgstr "¿Cómo le reconoceré?\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_107"
msgid ""
"We don't have an image record, and we can't \n"
"find any official files. All we have is the \n"
"name. Good luck, Perfect Dark.\n"
msgstr ""
"No tenemos ninguna imagen grabada, y no hemos \n"
"encontrado ficheros oficiales. Todo lo que tenemos \n"
"es su nombre. Buena suerte, Perfect Dark.\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_108"
msgid "Right, I'm in...\n"
msgstr "Bien, estoy dentro...\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_109"
msgid "I...I'm logging on now.\n"
msgstr "Estoy... estoy entrando ahora.\n"
